WEBVTT

00:09:57.684 --> 00:10:00.385
Ademais, dámoslles o valor
para perseguir os seus soños

00:10:00.973 --> 00:10:02.656
no mundo real, en tempo real.

00:10:03.264 --> 00:10:04.013
Grazas.

00:10:04.013 --> 00:10:08.206
(Aplausos)

00:10:08.206 --> 00:10:08.971
Grazas.

00:10:09.026 --> 00:10:13.888
(Aplausos)